  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\left\\{\\frac{6 !}{p ! q ! r !} a^{q+r} b^{p+r} c^{p+q}\\right.$\r\n$q+r=3, p+r=4, p+q=5, p+q+r=6$\r\n$\\Rightarrow p=3, q=2, r=1$\r\nco-efficient $=\\frac{6 !}{3 ! 2 !}$",
